IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ea-cpc-interface`
IMPORT `written-law-interface`
IMPORT `cpc-types`
IMPORT `cpc-first-schedule`
IMPORT `cpc-offence-procedure`
IMPORT `cpc-second-schedule`
IMPORT `cpc-other-laws`

-- INDEPENDENT TEST PASS for the Criminal Procedure Code 2010 encoding (First Schedule, ss 2(1), 7-9, Second Schedule, ss 159, 211A, other-law interaction).
-- Expected values were decided from the SSO PDF/text alone and written down in independent-pass-answers.md BEFORE any .l4 was opened.
-- Failing assertions are findings: they are left failing.  Generated by a scratch script; not for editing expected values to suit the code.

@ref "independent pass"
GIVEN label IS A STRING
GIVETH A LIST OF `First Schedule Row`
`rows printed as` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `printed section` EQUALS label) `the rows of the First Schedule`

GIVEN death IS A BOOLEAN, life IS A BOOLEAN, fine IS A BOOLEAN, years IS A NUMBER, pc IS A BOOLEAN, fsmc IS A BOOLEAN, fsdc IS A BOOLEAN, omc IS A BOOLEAN, odc IS A BOOLEAN, ppmc IS A BOOLEAN, ppdc IS A BOOLEAN, cons IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Jurisdiction Facts`
`jf` MEANS
    `Jurisdiction Facts` WITH
        `the offence is punishable with death` IS death
        `the offence is punishable with imprisonment for life` IS life
        `the offence is a fine-only offence` IS fine
        `the maximum term of imprisonment provided by law, in years` IS years
        `the offence is under the Penal Code 1871` IS pc
        `the First Schedule shows the offence as triable by a Magistrate's Court` IS fsmc
        `the First Schedule shows the offence as triable by a District Court` IS fsdc
        `a law other than the Penal Code 1871 shows the offence as triable by a Magistrate's Court under that law` IS omc
        `a law other than the Penal Code 1871 shows the offence as triable by a District Court under that law` IS odc
        `the Public Prosecutor has authorised in writing a Magistrate's Court to try the offence in the particular case` IS ppmc
        `the Public Prosecutor applies to the District Court to try the offence` IS ppdc
        `the accused consents, or if more than one are charged together with the same offence, all consent` IS cons

GIVEN act IS A STRING, deems IS A BOOLEAN, empowers IS A BOOLEAN, dc IS A BOOLEAN, mc IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Written Law Procedure Statement`
`stmt` MEANS
    `Written Law Procedure Statement` WITH
        `the Act` IS act
        `the Act deems the offence to be an arrestable offence for the purposes of the Criminal Procedure Code 2010` IS deems
        `the Act empowers the police to arrest without warrant for the offence` IS empowers
        `the Act shows the offence as triable by a District Court under that Act` IS dc
        `the Act shows the offence as triable by a Magistrate's Court under that Act` IS mc

GIVEN act IS A STRING, section IS A STRING, qualified IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Written Law Offence Facts`
`wlo` MEANS
    `Written Law Offence Facts` WITH
        `the Act under which the offence is created` IS act
        `the section of that Act, without subsections` IS section
        `the offence is under the Act as in force immediately before the date the Second Schedule item names` IS qualified

GIVEN dc IS A BOOLEAN, consent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `State Court Disclosure Facts`
`scd` MEANS
    `State Court Disclosure Facts` WITH
        `the offence is to be tried in a District Court` IS dc
        `all parties consent to have the criminal case disclosure procedures apply` IS consent

GIVEN mustHc IS A BOOLEAN, designates IS A BOOLEAN, consent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `High Court Disclosure Facts`
`hcd` MEANS
    `High Court Disclosure Facts` WITH
        `the offence must be tried in the General Division of the High Court` IS mustHc
        `the Public Prosecutor designates the General Division of the High Court to try the offence` IS designates
        `all parties consent to have the criminal case disclosure procedures apply` IS consent

