-- Penal Code listed whole
#ASSERT `the offence is under a law specified in the Second Schedule` (`wlo` "Penal Code 1871" "300" FALSE)
-- MDA listed whole
#ASSERT `the offence is under a law specified in the Second Schedule` (`wlo` "Misuse of Drugs Act 1973" "5" FALSE)

