§ `H. Section 211A`

-- murder, must be tried in HC; Penal Code
#ASSERT `the criminal case disclosure procedures of Part 10 Division 5 apply` (`wlo` "Penal Code 1871" "300" FALSE) (`hcd` TRUE FALSE FALSE)
